    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/c980e18001707b1acef46b7d7cae518d.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=635 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RISE OF THE ORDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen years have passed since the events of <i>Playtown</i> and <i>Playtown 2</i>. The once-abandoned indoor playground has mysteriously reopened, and something sinister lurks beneath the surface. Determined to put an end to the enigmatic <strong>E.Y.E. Order</strong>, the protagonist infiltrates Playtown and soon realizes their suspicions were right. What was once a playground is now a front for something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/ddd4a68524553a3e305407dda6fbe8b3.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP HEXCOR BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying reality unfolds. Playtown is just the beginning. The E.Y.E. Order has expanded beneath <strong>California</strong>, with countless hidden facilities fueling their twisted experiments. At the center of it all is Hexcor, their leader, their mastermind, their god. He has set something catastrophic in motion, and if you don\u2019t act fast, the consequences could be <strong>irreversible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth. Survive the horrors. End the Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/8991d3ea0d9ccfe6777ff3319772c07c.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark secrets of Playtown 3 with a powerful new tool, the Crystal Remote, which lets you activate doors, bridges, and hidden mechanisms. Solve creative, one of a kind puzzles that challenge your wits as you navigate a decaying world crawling with intelligent mascots. These creatures don\u2019t just follow patterns; they see, they hear, and they hunt. Use stealth to survive: stay quiet, stay out of sight, and keep moving. Every moment brings you closer to stopping the mysterious E.Y.E. Order before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/cb424d47865de388189284389bff9852.avif?t=1755709020\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/c980e18001707b1acef46b7d7cae518d.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=635 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RISE OF THE ORDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen years have passed since the events of <i>Playtown</i> and <i>Playtown 2</i>. The once-abandoned indoor playground has mysteriously reopened, and something sinister lurks beneath the surface. Determined to put an end to the enigmatic <strong>E.Y.E. Order</strong>, the protagonist infiltrates Playtown and soon realizes their suspicions were right. What was once a playground is now a front for something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/ddd4a68524553a3e305407dda6fbe8b3.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP HEXCOR BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying reality unfolds. Playtown is just the beginning. The E.Y.E. Order has expanded beneath <strong>California</strong>, with countless hidden facilities fueling their twisted experiments. At the center of it all is Hexcor, their leader, their mastermind, their god. He has set something catastrophic in motion, and if you don\u2019t act fast, the consequences could be <strong>irreversible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth. Survive the horrors. End the Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/8991d3ea0d9ccfe6777ff3319772c07c.avif?t=1755709020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark secrets of Playtown 3 with a powerful new tool, the Crystal Remote, which lets you activate doors, bridges, and hidden mechanisms. Solve creative, one of a kind puzzles that challenge your wits as you navigate a decaying world crawling with intelligent mascots. These creatures don\u2019t just follow patterns; they see, they hear, and they hunt. Use stealth to survive: stay quiet, stay out of sight, and keep moving. Every moment brings you closer to stopping the mysterious E.Y.E. Order before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/cb424d47865de388189284389bff9852.avif?t=1755709020\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Thirteen years later, Playtown reopens, but it's no longer just a playground. Uncover the dark rise of the enigmatic E.Y.E. Order, battle terrifying mutated mascots, and stop Hexcor before his plan destroys everything. The truth lies beneath. Survive the nightmare. End the Order.",
